{"id":367,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自然の中で個性を育てる菅生中等部","feature_description":"東海大学菅生高等学校中等部は、『自然が教科書だ。』の精神のもと、自然環境の中で感性と個性を育てる学校です。医学・難関大コースと一貫進学コースがあり、クラブ活動も活発で、教室外の体験から学びを深めやすいです。自然体験と部活動の往復で、日々の成長を実感しやすいです。コース選択と自然教育が、日常の学びに厚みを加えます。学校外の活動にも広がりがあります。","clubs":[{"id":6743,"name":"野球クラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokaisugao-jhs.ed.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6744,"name":"サッカークラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokaisugao-jhs.ed.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6745,"name":"ソフトボールクラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokaisugao-jhs.ed.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6746,"name":"硬式テニスクラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokaisugao-jhs.ed.jp/school-life/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6747,"name":"バレーボールクラブ(女子)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokaisugao-jhs.ed.jp/news/4478/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6748,"name":"バドミントンクラブ(女子)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokaisugao-jhs.ed.jp/news/4478/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6749,"name":"バスケットボールクラブ(男子)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokaisugao-jhs.ed.jp/news/4478/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6750,"name":"剣道クラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokaisugao-jhs.ed.jp/news/blog-club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6751,"name":"卓球クラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokaisugao-jhs.ed.jp/news/4478/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6752,"name":"女子チアダンスクラブ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tokaisugao-jhs.ed.jp/news/4478/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6753,"name":"吹奏楽クラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tokaisugao-jhs.ed.jp/news/4669/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6754,"name":"エコクラブ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tokaisugao-jhs.ed.jp/news/4478/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":3066,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","sour